#. L_RIT_035
msgid "Who are you, young lady?\n"
msgstr "¿Quién es usted, jovencita?\n"

#. L_RIT_036
msgid "Security, SECURITY!!\n"
msgstr "¡¡Seguridad, SEGURIDAD!!\n"

#. L_RIT_037
msgid ""
"Mr. President, you're in danger. Trent is trying to \n"
"kidnap you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sr. Presidente, está usted en peligro. Trent intenta \n"
"secuestrarle.\n"

#. L_RIT_038
msgid "What the hell was that!\n"
msgstr "¡Qué demonios es eso!\n"

#. L_RIT_039
msgid ""
"We have to get you to the escape pod. \n"
"Follow me.\n"
msgstr ""
"Debemos llevarle a la cápsula de escape. \n"
"Sígame.\n"

#. L_RIT_040
msgid ""
"You can't make accusations like that without evidence.\n"
" I assume that you have some?\n"
msgstr ""
"No puede hacer acusaciones como ésa sin evidencias.\n"
" ¿Asumo que tendrá alguna?\n"

#. L_RIT_041
msgid ""
"This is a recording of a meeting between \n"
"Trent and the other conspirators.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ésta es una grabación de una reunión entre \n"
"Trent y los otros conspiradores.\n"

#. L_RIT_042
msgid ""
"Seems overwhelming... I'm in your hands. \n"
"What do we do now?\n"
msgstr ""
"Parece abrumador... Estoy en sus manos. \n"
"¿Qué hacemos ahora?\n"

#. L_RIT_043
msgid "Hey, that's not...\n"
msgstr "Hey, tú no eres...\n"

#. L_RIT_044
msgid "It's an intruder...\n"
msgstr "Es una intrusa...\n"

#. L_RIT_045
msgid "How the hell did you get on board?\n"
msgstr "¿Cómo ha subido a bordo?\n"

#. L_RIT_046
msgid "Now, let's retrieve the evidence.\n"
msgstr "Ahora, recuperemos la evidencia.\n"

#. L_RIT_047
msgid ""
"The President's room is on this \n"
"level, Joanna.\n"
msgstr ""
"La habitación del Presidente está en \n"
"este nivel, Joanna.\n"

#. L_RIT_048
msgid "Something's wrong... You have to get to the cockpit!\n"
msgstr "Algo va mal... ¡Debes llegar a la cabina!\n"

#. L_RIT_049
msgid "Maybe a mine will detach the UFO.\n"
msgstr "Quizá una mina separe el OVNI.\n"

